5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I am worried the ground might be tricky. Who else thinks we should check the soil first?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,I just want to know what this will cost us to keep running. Who is looking at the budget?,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I have seen many pretty plans fail. I would like to see what happened to our last projects.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I am curious who will actually maintain this place. The staff numbers seem low.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,The park is used daily. We need to know how people actually move through it.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, the budget is important, but if the ground fails, the cost goes up.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, true, but I need to see the long-term upkeep figures to be sure.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I agree with Minato. The condition of past works tells us a lot about durability.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I will look into the staffing. If we have no one to care for it, it fails.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I will check the drainage and heat data. The environment dictates the design.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,I will look into the firms tendering for earth-moving. I want to know their capacity.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,I will check the upkeep ledger. I need to see the real annual costs per hectare.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will review the condition of works from the earlier programme. History repeats itself.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will examine the groundskeeping roll. I need to know who is on the roster.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will look at the drainage callouts and heat readings. The data will speak.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,I also want to see the depot phasing notes. How can we keep the park open?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,May,,I will also check the terms of the regional habitat fund. Funding sources matter.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I will also look at the record of the eastern avenue planting. It is a good example.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I will also check the volunteer groups. They might help fill the gaps.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I will also check the timed counts of weekday crossings. Usage patterns are key.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
