35,2,1,talk,Minato,,The firms say the clay is risky. We can only do shallow work easily.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,May,,"@Minato, that is worrying. My findings show planted ground costs triple to maintain.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"I found that the old basin is fine, but the paved apron is failing. Planting is better if cared for.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Victoria,,I found the staff is down to seven. But volunteers are active on weekends.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"The data shows people want firm ground. Also, heat is a real problem here.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Shunichi, if we do shallow work, we avoid the clay risk. That is good.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,May,,"@Shizue, if planting is cheaper to build but expensive to keep, we need a plan.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@May, the eastern trees died because no one watered them. We must include aftercare.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Shizue, the volunteers do habitat work. Maybe they can help with the planting?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,The heat readings are high. We need shade. But people walk on hard ground.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minato,,I think we should avoid deep digging. Shallow planting is safer for the ground.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,May,,I am concerned about the long-term cost. Hard surfaces are cheaper to maintain.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shizue,,I believe we can make planting work if we commit to the aftercare. It is worth it.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Victoria,,The volunteer groups are a resource. We should use them for the maintenance.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"We need a balance. Shade for heat, but firm paths for the commuters.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minato,,I am leaning towards a plan that respects the ground limits.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,May,,I need to see how the funding covers the maintenance. It is a big gap.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"I am hopeful. If we learn from the past, we can do this right.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"I am confident the volunteers can help, but we need a clear structure.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,The data supports a mixed approach. We cannot ignore the heat or the foot traffic.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
