70,3,3,talk,Minato,,I think Option A is the safest for the ground and the budget.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,May,,I will support Option A if we can secure the aftercare funding.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I am voting for Option A. It is a step in the right direction.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Victoria,,I am voting for Option A. The volunteer support is a strong plus.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I am voting for Option A. It balances the environmental and practical needs.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Minato,,I am glad we are all in agreement. Option A seems like the best choice.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,May,,Let's hope the funding works out. I will keep an eye on the accounts.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I am looking forward to seeing the trees grow. It will be a beautiful place.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Victoria,,I will coordinate with the volunteers to ensure they are ready.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,The data supports this choice. Let's proceed with Option A.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
